;
; corridor_room.tres — Mineshaft open room piece.
; 6m × 6m square room with cobblestone walls, stone floor + ceiling. 4m tall.
; Contains a bronze chest at room centre (mineshaft loot tier per DOCS §4.4).
; Bricks: 4 lanterns on walls + chest in centre.
; DOCS.md §2 — mineshafts; DOCS §4.4 — mineshaft loot table (bronze tier); CONTEXT.md D-07.
; allowed_biomes = [] — depth-gated by multipass_generator.

